stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received
    Received --> Diagnosing: Open the case
    Diagnosing --> Repairing: Fault found
    Diagnosing --> Waiting: Need a part
    Waiting --> Repairing: Part arrives
    Repairing --> Testing
    Testing --> Repairing: Try again
    Testing --> Returned: Works safely
    Returned --> [*]
